{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39649032",
      "title": "Alternative Props Syntaxes",
      "sourceHash": "f83c0dba0ca3fa0b967f7e833bd1f572111401ed72016bb66b847eff53bc5112",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.486,
          "end": 3.373,
          "en": "Now, to finish the other items here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.373,
          "end": 5.746,
          "en": "attached, you find a new file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.746,
          "end": 8.634,
          "en": "a data.js file which you should download",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.634,
          "end": 12.617,
          "en": "and add next to this App.jsx file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.617,
          "end": 14.89,
          "en": "or you create a new file and simply copy",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.89,
          "end": 19.653,
          "en": "in the content of the attached data.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.653,
          "end": 23.28,
          "en": "And in that file, you simply find an array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.28,
          "end": 26.503,
          "en": "with a bunch of objects where every object simply",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.503,
          "end": 31.372,
          "en": "is one core concept that should be output here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.372,
          "end": 33.629,
          "en": "That's why in every object, you have an image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.629,
          "end": 35.993,
          "en": "a title, and a description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.993,
          "end": 37.503,
          "en": "And the images are simply imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.503,
          "end": 39.633,
          "en": "from the assets folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.49,
          "end": 44.249,
          "en": "So with that file added here in App.jsx,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.249,
          "end": 49.249,
          "en": "we can and should, of course, import CORE CONCEPTS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.47,
          "end": 52.001,
          "en": "and you should import it like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.001,
          "end": 55.236,
          "en": "with curly braces around CORE CONCEPTS from data.js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.236,
          "end": 58.402,
          "en": "with curly braces around CORE CONCEPTS from data.js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.402,
          "end": 63.3,
          "en": "Since CORE CONCEPTS in data.js is a named export",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 63.3,
          "end": 65.146,
          "en": "and when having such named exports,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.146,
          "end": 68.131,
          "en": "not default exports, in JavaScript,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.131,
          "end": 70.644,
          "en": "you import with curly braces around",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.644,
          "end": 74.373,
          "en": "the name of the thing you are importing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 75.27,
          "end": 77.76,
          "en": "And with that being imported here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.76,
          "end": 78.992,
          "en": "we can use CORE CONCEPTS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 78.992,
          "end": 83.249,
          "en": "to dynamically set the title and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.249,
          "end": 84.504,
          "en": "We can access the first item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.504,
          "end": 86.992,
          "en": "in this CORE CONCEPTS array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 86.992,
          "end": 89.67,
          "en": "which is this object here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.67,
          "end": 93.40299999999999,
          "en": "and then access its title, description, and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.40299999999999,
          "end": 95.491,
          "en": "So here we can then set title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 95.491,
          "end": 99.47999999999999,
          "en": "to CORE CONCEPTS[0].title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 99.47999999999999,
          "end": 102.892,
          "en": "Do the same here for the description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.892,
          "end": 107.75999999999999,
          "en": "And then also, of course, down here for the image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 107.75999999999999,
          "end": 110.99000000000001,
          "en": "set this to .image, which also means that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 110.99000000000001,
          "end": 113.75999999999999,
          "en": "of course, now we can get rid of this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 113.75999999999999,
          "end": 117,
          "en": "separate componentsImg import here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117,
          "end": 119.34,
          "en": "So with that, we're using CORE CONCEPTS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.34,
          "end": 123.003,
          "en": "And now, we can replicate this three times",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 123.003,
          "end": 128.003,
          "en": "and just replace the index zero with index one,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 128.008,
          "end": 131.351,
          "en": "and then index two,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 131.351,
          "end": 134.34,
          "en": "and then index three.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 134.34,
          "end": 137.00900000000001,
          "en": "And with that, we are using the same component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 137.00900000000001,
          "end": 139.238,
          "en": "with different input data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 139.238,
          "end": 141.752,
          "en": "which is now set dynamically depending",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 141.752,
          "end": 144.963,
          "en": "on the index of the item we're accessing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 145.89,
          "end": 147.761,
          "en": "And with that, if you save that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 147.761,
          "end": 151.001,
          "en": "you should see these Core Concepts on the screen now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 151.001,
          "end": 152.74,
          "en": "And the great thing here, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 152.74,
          "end": 155.733,
          "en": "is that we're now seeing all these items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 155.733,
          "end": 158.26,
          "en": "even though we just have one component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 158.26,
          "end": 162.14,
          "en": "But thanks to props, this component is reusable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 162.14,
          "end": 162.994,
          "en": "But what you can, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 162.994,
          "end": 165.486,
          "en": "see down here in the code is that we do have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 165.486,
          "end": 170.246,
          "en": "to write quite a lot of code to make this work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 170.246,
          "end": 173.228,
          "en": "Not horrible, but also not optimal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 173.228,
          "end": 176.228,
          "en": "Now, thankfully, we can use a shortcut here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 176.228,
          "end": 178.748,
          "en": "If you have a situation like this here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 178.748,
          "end": 182.01,
          "en": "where your prop names are similar",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 182.01,
          "end": 184.506,
          "en": "to the property names of the object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 184.506,
          "end": 187.863,
          "en": "that contains the data you wanna set,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 187.863,
          "end": 190.983,
          "en": "you can set the data like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 190.983,
          "end": 194.52,
          "en": "but you can also instead get rid of all these props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 194.52,
          "end": 196.746,
          "en": "and add opening and closing curly braces",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 196.746,
          "end": 200.62,
          "en": "just like this directly on the component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 200.62,
          "end": 202.633,
          "en": "So not as an attribute value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 202.633,
          "end": 204.18,
          "en": "but just like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 204.18,
          "end": 207.06,
          "en": "Put onto the component tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 207.06,
          "end": 209.639,
          "en": "And then there, you can use the spread operator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 209.639,
          "end": 212.747,
          "en": "that's built-in to JavaScript to pull out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 212.747,
          "end": 216.244,
          "en": "all the key value pairs of an object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 216.244,
          "end": 217.747,
          "en": "So in this case, the first object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 217.747,
          "end": 219.873,
          "en": "in this CORE CONCEPTS array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 220.74,
          "end": 222.781,
          "en": "And by using this syntax,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 222.781,
          "end": 227.01,
          "en": "these key value pairs in this object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 227.01,
          "end": 230.28,
          "en": "will be added as key value pairs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 230.28,
          "end": 233.994,
          "en": "so as props to this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 233.994,
          "end": 235.744,
          "en": "So this code here will give us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 235.744,
          "end": 238.62,
          "en": "the same result as this code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 238.62,
          "end": 240.758,
          "en": "but it is, of course, much shorter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 240.758,
          "end": 244.278,
          "en": "Though here, of course, we want to use the index one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 244.278,
          "end": 246.747,
          "en": "But with that, we got a shorter alternative",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 246.747,
          "end": 250.71,
          "en": "which we can use on all components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 250.71,
          "end": 253.86,
          "en": "And I'm just keeping the longer alternative here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 253.86,
          "end": 255.77100000000002,
          "en": "so that you can also still see this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 255.77100000000002,
          "end": 257.489,
          "en": "And also, because it's, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 257.489,
          "end": 261.27,
          "en": "absolutely fine to use this alternative,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 261.27,
          "end": 262.103,
          "en": "but you also might wanna go",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 262.103,
          "end": 264.693,
          "en": "for this shorter alternative instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 265.62,
          "end": 268.023,
          "en": "And speaking of shorter alternatives,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 268.023,
          "end": 269.743,
          "en": "there also is an alternative",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 269.743,
          "end": 272.61,
          "en": "inside of this component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 272.61,
          "end": 274.739,
          "en": "Here, we're accessing the different props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 274.739,
          "end": 279.382,
          "en": "with props.title, props.description and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 279.382,
          "end": 283.762,
          "en": "And this, also, is absolutely fine and works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 283.762,
          "end": 285.775,
          "en": "As you can see, if you saved this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 285.775,
          "end": 289.02,
          "en": "we still see the same result as before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 289.02,
          "end": 290.731,
          "en": "But you can also use another JavaScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 290.731,
          "end": 294.008,
          "en": "feature here in the parameter list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 294.008,
          "end": 296.673,
          "en": "You can use object destructuring",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 296.673,
          "end": 300.78,
          "en": "by adding opening and closing curly braces here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 300.78,
          "end": 303.484,
          "en": "And these opening and closing curly braces",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 303.484,
          "end": 306.233,
          "en": "have nothing to do with these opening",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 306.233,
          "end": 309.5,
          "en": "and closing curly braces down here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 309.5,
          "end": 311.396,
          "en": "They have nothing to do with that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 311.396,
          "end": 314.94,
          "en": "Instead here, when used in this parameter list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 314.94,
          "end": 317.63,
          "en": "these opening and closing curly braces here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 317.63,
          "end": 320.01800000000003,
          "en": "are used to destructure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 320.01800000000003,
          "end": 323.43,
          "en": "the first parameter of this function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 323.43,
          "end": 326.52,
          "en": "so the props parameter in this case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 326.52,
          "end": 330.738,
          "en": "And object destructuring in JavaScript simply means",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 330.738,
          "end": 334.51,
          "en": "that we can target the different properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 334.51,
          "end": 338.61,
          "en": "of the incoming object by name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 338.61,
          "end": 341.761,
          "en": "So here, we have to use the same properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 341.761,
          "end": 344.79,
          "en": "as we're setting here as props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 344.79,
          "end": 346.563,
          "en": "So title, description, image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 348.102,
          "end": 351.887,
          "en": "Also, here in this object, image, title, description,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 351.887,
          "end": 355.122,
          "en": "we have to use these exact same words here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 355.122,
          "end": 357.69,
          "en": "between those curly braces.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 357.69,
          "end": 360.93,
          "en": "But when doing so, JavaScript will then go ahead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 360.93,
          "end": 364.02,
          "en": "and give us these three properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 364.02,
          "end": 367.89,
          "en": "as standalone variables in this function here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 367.89,
          "end": 369.504,
          "en": "And therefore, now we can output the image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 369.504,
          "end": 371.906,
          "en": "by just pointing at image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 371.906,
          "end": 374.76,
          "en": "the title by just using title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 374.76,
          "end": 377.67,
          "en": "and the description by just using description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 377.67,
          "end": 381.093,
          "en": "Hence allowing us to write less code here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 381.99,
          "end": 386.04,
          "en": "And you can use this object destructuring syntax here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 386.04,
          "end": 390.001,
          "en": "with that longer or that shorter props version here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 390.001,
          "end": 391.645,
          "en": "It does not matter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 391.645,
          "end": 394.01,
          "en": "It is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 394.01,
          "end": 395.743,
          "en": "If you save this, you therefore now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 395.743,
          "end": 398.981,
          "en": "still see the same result as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 398.981,
          "end": 402.723,
          "en": "but now, also, with less code in this component.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}